shortdesc Support for use of \parshape in LaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides macros and environments that relieve the
longdesc programmer of some of the difficulties of using \parshape in
longdesc LaTeX macros. It does not actually calculate shapes in the way
longdesc that the shapepar package does.
